ned}{y}_{1}=8 \\\\ -8{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}=-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this system is ${y}_{1}=8$ and ${y}_{2}=50.$ \n\nTherefore, $y=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 50\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2b6940e4-bb59-563a-a937-e93f48ec1bc6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2b6940e4-bb59-563a-a937-e93f48ec1bc6" :answer-field/id #uuid "2b6940e4-bb59-563a-a937-e93f48ec1bc6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0043e87e-f842-57e6-82bc-b4ea7ec5f162" :answer-field/choices ["answer-92afe7cc-d13c-59a1-b5db-5b37ab35d121" "answer-f363ef1a-e780-507a-81d1-0ea4237f7e39" "answer-2e8f7d3a-59d4-56b1-9c28-1128e20099aa" "answer-0043e87e-f842-57e6-82bc-b4ea7ec5f162" "answer-4856545f-c7b8-5207-946b-42bd4c1c3aa8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92afe7cc-d13c-59a1-b5db-5b37ab35d121" :answer/id #uuid "92afe7cc-d13c-59a1-b5db-5b37ab35d121" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ -50\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f363ef1a-e780-507a-81d1-0ea4237f7e39" :answer/id #uuid "f363ef1a-e780-507a-81d1-0ea4237f7e39" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 60\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e8f7d3a-59d4-56b1-9c28-1128e20099aa" :answer/id #uuid "2e8f7d3a-59d4-56b1-9c28-1128e20099aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -78\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0043e87e-f842-57e6-82bc-b4ea7ec5f162" :answer/id #uuid "0043e87e-f842-57e6-82bc-b4ea7ec5f162" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 50\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4856545f-c7b8-5207-946b-42bd4c1c3aa8" :answer/id #uuid "4856545f-c7b8-5207-946b-42bd4c1c3aa8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 64\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-084c02e4-7974-5581-92ae-668d0f97c0f4" :question/id #uuid "084c02e4-7974-5581-92ae-668d0f97c0f4" :question/math-academy-id "q-107170" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $L$ and the vector $b,$ given by \n\n$$\nL=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf $A=LU$ is the LU factorization of some $2\\times 2$ matrix $A,$ find the vector $y$ such that \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis equivalent to $Ax=b.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that since $A=LU,$ we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax=b\\,⟹\\,{{(LU)}_{⏟}}_{A}x=b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, setting $Ux=y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\nL{{(Ux)}_{⏟}}_{y}=b\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now solve $Ly=b.$ Writing this equation in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives the system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}=2 \\\\ -3{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this system is ${y}_{1}=2$ and ${y}_{2}=4.$ \n\nTherefore, $y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-61c0b255-63a0-5164-9dd6-3298c1d228e3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-61c0b255-63a0-5164-9dd6-3298c1d228e3" :answer-field/id #uuid "61c0b255-63a0-5164-9dd6-3298c1d228e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e65b36d6-4ce8-57b8-a24e-fa7877ec664c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-24c66c0e-e0d0-5c27-907f-9e31b4c17877" "answer-44df3446-722a-5a1f-9400-f9c2edb4a1ef" "answer-a1b54213-3d59-59c8-98ef-a8f08dbb4c4e" "answer-d1de89e0-2dc2-5990-94a4-6e3067c9a319" "answer-e65b36d